  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/b3wKSVMw/images/5690c631eed95069bb20fe75b93058d354b73d7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1009\"></p><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>本模組讓玩家能為盔甲以外的物品添加裝飾紋樣。預設支援所有原版鎬、斧、鏟、劍、鋤以及剪刀。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此外，你還可以找到新的鍛造模板，當搭配盔甲或工具與螢光墨囊使用時，能讓裝飾紋樣在黑暗中發光。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>工具裝飾紋樣預設支援以下模組：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/477/194/637771671789296797.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 豐富生態系 (Biomes O' Plenty)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elytra-trims\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XpzGz7KD/8ff6751948e096f540e320681742d0b3b918931e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"> 鞘翅紋樣 (Elytra Trims)</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LuJJMv1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"1\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>使用權限：</strong></p><ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>您可將本模組用於自製整合包。</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未經許可，禁止在未提供<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trims-on-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftrims-on-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>下載連結的情況下重新發布本模組（請私訊<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=Zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.zeith.org/icons/zeitheron.png\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\">&nbsp;Zeitheron</a>或透過Discord聯繫）</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>禁止將本模組（或DragonForge團隊任何其他模組）整合至您的模組中。但允許製作附加元件，建議事先友善告知。</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>注意：</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong>本模組僅支援最新版Minecraft，恕不提供舊版支援！</strong></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fds.zeith.org%252fdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ds.zeith.org/cards/dev.png\" width=\"510\" height=\"170\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想參與討論？需要API協助？</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎加入Discord伺服器，並追蹤Zeitheron的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252fZeithTwitter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/favicons/twitter.ico\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">Twitter</a>！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>若您願意支持我的創作，可透過<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/zeitheron\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;Patreon</a>贊助。<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/pix.iemoji.com/twit33/0744.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"33\"></strong></p>",
